<view class="order-success">
  <view class="box m-def p-def bgw txt-c br-16">
    <view class="mod1 flex-vc">
      <image
        class
        style="width:224rpx;height:224rpx"
        src="https://zyt-network.oss-cn-qingdao.aliyuncs.com/images/order-success.png"
      />
      <text class="black" style="font-size:44rpx">下单成功</text>
    </view>

    <view class="mod2 flex-vc">
      <!-- <text class="fs-28 c-777 mt-10">预计上门时间：明天09:00-12:00</text> -->

      <view class="fs-26 c-aaa mt-10 mb-10 my-red flex">
        <image
          style="width:38rpx;height:34rpx;margin-top:1px"
          class="mr-2"
          src="https://zyt-network.oss-cn-qingdao.aliyuncs.com/images/order-success/pour.png"
        />
        <text>预计明天微信提醒支付邮费\n逾期支付的包裹会退回！</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="mod3">
      <view class="flex-sb-c mb-2">
        <van-button
          round
          plain
          type="primary"
          custom-style="width:280rpx;height:90rpx"
          bind:tap="checkOrder"
        >查看订单</van-button>
        <van-button
          round
          type="primary"
          custom-style="width:280rpx;height:90rpx"
          bind:tap="anotherOrder"
        >再来一单</van-button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="m-def bgw" style="border-radius: 16rpx;">
    <van-notice-bar
      class="my-notice-bar"
      left-icon="https://zyt-network.oss-cn-qingdao.aliyuncs.com/images/alert.png"
      text="下单后支付运费，未支付的包裹会退回哦！"
      scrollable="{{false}}"
    />
  </view>

  <van-dialog
    use-slot
    title="{{null}}"
    show="{{ show1 }}"
    showConfirmButton="{{false}}"
    bind:close="onClose6"
    round
    class="my-dialog6"
    custom-class="my-dialog6-class"
  >
    <view class="show6-dialog rel flex-vc">
      <view class="white txt-c full-w">
        <view class="fs-36 mt-10 mb-3">重要通知</view>
        <view class="fs-28">已下单成功!</view>
      </view>

      <view class="main fs-28">
        <view style="margin-top:40px">1.明天8点后微信推送运费支付</view>
        <view style="margin-top:20px">2.您还可以搜索【逍遥邮】小程序支付</view>
        <view style="margin-top:20px" class="my-red">3.逾期支付的包裹会退回! ! !</view>
      </view>

      <e-button
        type="primary"
        class="theme btn-br-48 fs-28 mt-9 mb-10"
        customStyle="width:280px;height: 44px;"
        bindtap="gotIt"
      >知道了</e-button>

      <image
        bindtap="gotIt"
        class="close"
        src="https://zyt-network.oss-cn-qingdao.aliyuncs.com/images/order-success/icon-close.png"
      />
    </view>
  </van-dialog>
</view>
